# External research tools, fetched fresh to upstream latest via `just fetch-externals`.
# Not git submodules: submodules pin a SHA, which rots (orphaned upstream commits,
# stale clones). These are tracked dirs only on disk, never committed.
src.bak/backends/external/carat/
src.bak/backends/external/vinbergs_algorithm/references/VinbergsAlgorithmNF/
src.bak/backends/external/vinbergs_algorithm/references/vinal/
